    "sections": {
        "description": "Handmade Craft Studio is a clean and thoughtfully structured theme designed for artisans, makers, and small creative businesses. It supports a smooth workflow for showcasing handmade products, portfolios, and craft collections with clarity and visual balance. Built with a lightweight framework, it ensures fast loading and easy customization through the Customizer. The theme includes flexible layout options, product display sections, and blog integration for storytelling. It is suitable for craft stores, handmade shops, DIY blogs, and creative portfolios. Additional sections for featured collections and creator highlights help organize content more effectively. With well-organized typography and spacing, it enhances content readability while maintaining a balanced visual style. Compatible with popular plugins and optimized for SEO, Handmade Craft Studio helps improve discoverability and user engagement across devices while supporting smooth navigation and consistent performance."
    },
